OL,12,G2100 The Great Devon & Cornwall Floods
OL,13,     FIn 1952 a flash flood in Lynmouth,
OL,14,     FDevon, caused the death of 34
OL,15,     Fpeople as debris smashed into
OL,16,     Fbuildings. Then exactly 52 years
OL,17,     Flater, an eerily similar event
OL,18,     Fstruck Boscastle in Cornwall.
